# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment variables for the Cybersecurity Portfolio
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit `.env.local` or real secrets to Git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Public site URL (used for SEO canonical URLs, Open Graph, sitemap).
# Example for production: https://your-domain.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact form delivery (OPTIONAL).
#
# The contact API route (app/api/contact/route.ts) works WITHOUT any provider:
# by default it validates and logs the submission server-side so the site runs
# out of the box. To actually deliver messages to your inbox, plug in ONE
# transactional email provider below and the route will use it automatically.
#
# Option A — Resend (https://resend.com). Recommended, free tier available.
# RESEND_API_KEY=your_resend_api_key_here
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=your-destination-inbox@example.com
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=portfolio@your-verified-domain.com
#
# These keys are read ONLY on the server (no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix) and are never
# exposed to the browser bundle.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
